# HELP gpon_gem_frames_total GEM frames on a GEM port since the flow was created: received downstream, sent upstream. A GEM frame is a fragment of an Ethernet frame or a whole one.
# TYPE gpon_gem_frames_total counter
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="ds",gem_port="4095"} 10
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="ds",gem_port="1434"} 20000
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="ds",gem_port="1435"} 12
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="ds",gem_port="1440"} 4294967295
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="us",gem_port="1562"} 13000
gpon_gem_frames_total{direction="us",gem_port="1566"} 330
# HELP gpon_gem_bytes_total Bytes on a GEM port since the flow was created: received downstream, sent upstream.
